<title>USA: BT Securities wins New Cannan, Conn., $25 mln BANs.</title>
<headline>BT Securities wins New Cannan, Conn., $25 mln BANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities said it won $25 million of New Cannan, Conn., bond anticipation notes (BANs).</p>
<p>The issue was won with a net interest cost of 3.449 and a coupon of 3.75 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
